---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import { templateBySlug } from '../../data/templates.mjs';
const templates=['career-skill-gap-map','portfolio-project-brief','ai-case-study','responsible-job-search','learning-sprint-plan'];
---
<BaseLayout title="AI careers and students 15+" description="Role exploration, skill-gap planning, portfolio projects, and responsible AI job-search guidance for professionals and students aged 15+."><div class="shell"><div class="reading"><p class="eyebrow">Professionals and students aged 15+</p><h1>Build evidence of skill—not a pile of course badges.</h1><p class="lede">Choose a role direction, make a 90-day plan, and create small projects that show how you frame, test, and responsibly use AI.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/tools/career-roadmap-builder/">Build my 90-day roadmap</a><a class="button secondary" href="/tracks/careers/">Open the complete track</a></div></div><section class="feature-panel section-space"><div><h2>A credible portfolio shows</h2><ul><li>A real user and bounded problem</li><li>A baseline and evaluation method</li><li>Failures and what you changed</li><li>Your exact contribution</li><li>Privacy and responsible-use decisions</li></ul></div><div><h2>Career templates</h2><ul>{templates.map((slug)=><li><a href={`/templates/${slug}/`}>{templateBySlug[slug].title}</a></li>)}</ul></div></section><section class="reading section-space"><h2>Important boundary</h2><p>These resources do not promise employment, salary, admission, or credential recognition. Verify current role requirements using employer postings, <a href="https://www.onetonline.org/">O*NET</a>, and the <a href="https://www.bls.gov/ooh/">U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics Occupational Outlook Handbook</a>.</p></section></div></BaseLayout>
